    "name": {
      "value": "Hired Killer"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "g&g"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Your life truly began after your first kill.\n\nMaybe you killed in self-defense, maybe it was a crime of passion, or maybe it was just an accident and you were a kid in the wrong place at the wrong time. In the end, the why doesn't matter. You got away with it.\n\nAnd then you found that maybe it didn't bother you as much as it should have. And maybe, just maybe, you had a talent you could use to forge a life for yourself. A blood-soaked talent and a blood-soaked life, sure. But it's yours.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One boost must be to Strength or Dexterity, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Stealth skill and the Underworld Lore skill. You gain the Terrain Stalker skill feat, choosing a terrain appropriate for where you make your kills."
    },
